   "method": "Tags are the artist's genres and most characteristic descriptive Last.fm tags (not generated text). wsim:tagPrompt and wsim:rank follow the artist's own tag weight (genres first), which identified the artist best in a prefix round trip. Each tag is assigned to one facet (rules + MiniLM similarity to facet anchor words); wsim:tagPromptByFacet lists the same tags ordered by facet (genre/style, instruments, vocals, mood, tempo, era, place, other).",
